# A live TOOL NAME is a surface claim too (#616). `oc-questions` IS
# tools/state/oc-questions, so a body naming it lands on the factory surface --
# but TOK requires a '/', so a name-only body yielded NO claim and read
# UNPINNED, which tiers a factory fix as P2. The lookbehind is the same path
# boundary: it is why `tools/state/oc-questions` is matched by TOK (preceded by
# '/') and never re-matched here as a bare name.
# Resolution is MECHANICAL -- the tools tree is enumerable -- so this is not a
# title-prefix test, which the scope law forbids (fix(tools): spans both repos:
# #471 and #405 are correctly P2 and name no live tool).
TOOLNAME = re.compile(r'(?<![\w/.-])(oc-[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]*)(?![\w-])')
